# Two turns the fake gateway billed (billed-turns.json: response-metadata,
# then a finish with providerMetadata.gateway.{routing.canonicalSlug, cost,
# generationId}), then the 30-day window, Enter, Down, Enter, and the session
# scope. `home` dumps what each binary keeps.
models models.json
gateway billed-turns.json
wait 2.5
type first question
key Enter
wait 4
type second question
key Enter
wait 4
snap turns
type /usage
key Enter
wait 3
snap d30
key Enter
wait 0.7
snap d30-expand
key Down
wait 0.5
snap d30-down
key Enter
wait 0.7
snap d30-down-expand
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
wait 1.5
snap session
key r
wait 1
snap session-r
key Tab
wait 1.5
snap wrap-30
home end
gwlog
key Escape
